  "face_rule": "faces[i].verts are CCW seen from outside (front face = GL CCW). verts[0] is the number's TOP (the triangle apex in the atlas), verts[1] bottom-left, verts[2] bottom-right; uv[k] goes with verts[k]. Faces are ordered by normal: top (+Y) first. Flat shading: one normal per face (expand to 60 vertices).",
